Subject: [PATCH] cache: andes-l2: enable DM events for post-relocation init

Upstream-Status: Pending

The Andes post-relocation cache init spy needs DM events even on boards
that disable EFI and do not otherwise select DM_EVENT.

diff --git a/drivers/cache/Kconfig b/drivers/cache/Kconfig
--- a/drivers/cache/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/cache/Kconfig
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@
 	bool "Andes L2 cache driver"
 	depends on RISCV
 	select CACHE
+	select DM_EVENT
 	help
 	  Support Andes L2 cache controller in AE350 platform.
 	  It will configure tag and data ram timing control from the
